<qti-assessment-item xmlns="http://www.imsglobal.org/xsd/imsqtiasi_v3p0" xmlns:xsi="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema-instance" xsi:schemaLocation="http://www.imsglobal.org/xsd/imsqtiasi_v3p0 https://purl.imsglobal.org/spec/qti/v3p0/schema/xsd/imsqti_asiv3p0_v1p0.xsd" identifier="pcb-item-2db59701c42549af91a7a9d8eca6a669" title="sat-c2-u16-colonization.html qc1" adaptive="true" time-dependent="false">
  <qti-response-declaration identifier="RESPONSE" cardinality="single" base-type="identifier">
    <qti-correct-response><qti-value>D</qti-value></qti-correct-response>
  </qti-response-declaration>
  <qti-outcome-declaration identifier="SCORE" cardinality="single" base-type="float"><qti-default-value><qti-value>0</qti-value></qti-default-value></qti-outcome-declaration>
  <qti-outcome-declaration identifier="FEEDBACK" cardinality="single" base-type="identifier"/>
  <qti-outcome-declaration identifier="INTERACTION_VISIBILITY" cardinality="single" base-type="identifier">
    <qti-default-value><qti-value>show_interaction</qti-value></qti-default-value>
  </qti-outcome-declaration>
  <qti-item-body>
    <qti-feedback-block identifier="show_interaction" outcome-identifier="INTERACTION_VISIBILITY" show-hide="show" class="qti-margin-0">
      <qti-content-body>
        <p>Which sentence uses &quot;colonization&quot; correctly?</p>
    <qti-choice-interaction response-identifier="RESPONSE" shuffle="true" max-choices="1">
      <qti-simple-choice identifier="A">The city&apos;s colonization of the brand-new stadium began at sunset, as thirty thousand fans streamed through the gates for the opening match of the season.</qti-simple-choice><qti-simple-choice identifier="B">Through patient colonization, the diplomats coaxed both delegations toward the ceasefire line by winter.</qti-simple-choice><qti-simple-choice identifier="C">The firm celebrated its colonization of a longtime rival on Friday, having bought every outstanding share of the company before the market&apos;s closing bell.</qti-simple-choice><qti-simple-choice identifier="D">Historians date the bay&apos;s colonization to the 1680s, when land grants drew four thousand overseas families to farm under a crown-appointed governor.</qti-simple-choice>
    </qti-choice-interaction>
      </qti-content-body>
    </qti-feedback-block>

    <qti-feedback-block identifier="FB-A" outcome-identifier="FEEDBACK" show-hide="show">
      <qti-content-body><p>Not quite! Colonization means settling your own people in a territory and ruling it for the home country, so it&apos;s not the correct choice here because fans filling a stadium for one evening are a crowd, not settlers — nobody stays, nobody governs, and the stadium was theirs to begin with.</p></qti-content-body>
    </qti-feedback-block>
    <qti-feedback-block identifier="FB-B" outcome-identifier="FEEDBACK" show-hide="show">
      <qti-content-body><p>Not quite! Colonization means settling your own people in a territory and ruling it for the home country, so it&apos;s not the correct choice here because coaxing two delegations toward a ceasefire is diplomacy — persuasion between parties, with no land settled and no one ruled.</p></qti-content-body>
    </qti-feedback-block>
    <qti-feedback-block identifier="FB-C" outcome-identifier="FEEDBACK" show-hide="show">
      <qti-content-body><p>Not quite! Colonization means settling your own people in a territory and ruling it for the home country, so it&apos;s not the correct choice here because buying a rival&apos;s shares is a corporate takeover — money changes hands, but no people are planted on any land.</p></qti-content-body>
    </qti-feedback-block>
    <qti-feedback-block identifier="FB-D" outcome-identifier="FEEDBACK" show-hide="show">
      <qti-content-body><p>Correct! Colonization means settling your own people in a territory and ruling it for the home country, so it&apos;s the correct answer because the land grants drew four thousand overseas families to stay and farm — under a governor the distant crown appointed.</p></qti-content-body>
    </qti-feedback-block>
  </qti-item-body>
  <qti-response-processing>
    <qti-response-condition>
    <qti-response-if>
      <qti-match><qti-variable identifier="RESPONSE"/><qti-base-value base-type="identifier">A</qti-base-value></qti-match>
      <qti-set-outcome-value identifier="SCORE"><qti-base-value base-type="float">0</qti-base-value></qti-set-outcome-value>
      <qti-set-outcome-value identifier="FEEDBACK"><qti-base-value base-type="identifier">FB-A</qti-base-value></qti-set-outcome-value>
    
        <qti-set-outcome-value identifier="completionStatus"><qti-base-value base-type="identifier">incomplete</qti-base-value></qti-set-outcome-value></qti-response-if>
    </qti-response-condition>
    <qti-response-condition>
    <qti-response-if>
      <qti-match><qti-variable identifier="RESPONSE"/><qti-base-value base-type="identifier">B</qti-base-value></qti-match>
      <qti-set-outcome-value identifier="SCORE"><qti-base-value base-type="float">0</qti-base-value></qti-set-outcome-value>
      <qti-set-outcome-value identifier="FEEDBACK"><qti-base-value base-type="identifier">FB-B</qti-base-value></qti-set-outcome-value>
    
        <qti-set-outcome-value identifier="completionStatus"><qti-base-value base-type="identifier">incomplete</qti-base-value></qti-set-outcome-value></qti-response-if>
    </qti-response-condition>
    <qti-response-condition>
    <qti-response-if>
      <qti-match><qti-variable identifier="RESPONSE"/><qti-base-value base-type="identifier">C</qti-base-value></qti-match>
      <qti-set-outcome-value identifier="SCORE"><qti-base-value base-type="float">0</qti-base-value></qti-set-outcome-value>
      <qti-set-outcome-value identifier="FEEDBACK"><qti-base-value base-type="identifier">FB-C</qti-base-value></qti-set-outcome-value>
    
        <qti-set-outcome-value identifier="completionStatus"><qti-base-value base-type="identifier">incomplete</qti-base-value></qti-set-outcome-value></qti-response-if>
    </qti-response-condition>
    <qti-response-condition>
    <qti-response-if>
      <qti-match><qti-variable identifier="RESPONSE"/><qti-base-value base-type="identifier">D</qti-base-value></qti-match>
      <qti-set-outcome-value identifier="SCORE"><qti-base-value base-type="float">1</qti-base-value></qti-set-outcome-value>
      <qti-set-outcome-value identifier="FEEDBACK"><qti-base-value base-type="identifier">FB-D</qti-base-value></qti-set-outcome-value>
    
        <qti-set-outcome-value identifier="completionStatus"><qti-base-value base-type="identifier">completed</qti-base-value></qti-set-outcome-value></qti-response-if>
    </qti-response-condition>
  </qti-response-processing>
</qti-assessment-item>
